"about.quienes.p1":"We are an organisation committed to environmental education and artistic expression as tools to reconnect people with nature, strengthen communities and bring about positive change in our surroundings.",
"about.quienes.p2":"We were born in 2020 with a simple idea: to recover our bond with the land, value traditions and create new ways to face today's challenges, such as rural depopulation and the climate crisis.","about.quienes.p3":"Through national and European projects, we combine learning, creativity and youth participation in fields such as film, theatre and music, because we believe art is a universal language able to inspire, bring people together and transform realities.",
